model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Hosted AppData running under the local provider uses the SDK's process-wide native runtime residency, shared across requests, with its existing limit and active-call holds. Deployed runtime adapters keep platform-owned eviction and no residency. Native Cloud evicts idle app and data-facet runtime adapters only through this bound, preserving account-selection reuse below it; unfinished calls and releases keep their runtime adapters loaded. Eviction creates its supervisor RPC stub lazily in the trimming request. Residency never shares invocation runners, build Effects or request-owned I/O. The same selection applies outside CI."
    }
  }
}
